WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.996 --> 00:00:05.758
Lady Whitebone sat by the road and sniffed the air again.

2
00:00:05.778 --> 00:00:07.880
"The Tang Monk has some powerful companions," she said.

3
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:35.057
"I need a Bajie dropped the bags.

4
00:00:36.337 --> 00:00:37.598
tired and hungry.

5
00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:39.599
Let's stop for lunch."

6
00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:47.642
Using his magic sight, Wukong saw a peach orchard thousands of miles away.

7
00:00:47.662 --> 00:00:51.544
"I'll be back in a minute," he said.

8
00:00:52.665 --> 00:00:57.026
Soon after the monkey had left, a young woman came down the road.

9
00:00:58.747 --> 00:01:00.168
She held out a bowl.

10
00:01:01.752 --> 00:01:03.014
you the Tang Monk?"

11
00:01:03.354 --> 00:01:03.954
she asked.

12
00:01:03.974 --> 00:01:05.796
"I have food for you."

13
00:01:07.177 --> 00:01:08.779
Bajie reached for the bowl.

14
00:01:08.799 --> 00:01:10.200
"Thank you!"

15
00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:12.882
"Don't eat that!"

16
00:01:13.263 --> 00:01:16.125
Wukong was flying fast, back to the group.

17
00:01:16.846 --> 00:01:20.329
He dropped all the peaches and pulled out his iron bar.

18
00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:24.133
He struck at the young woman.

19
00:01:24.913 --> 00:01:27.516
But before he hit her, she disappeared.

20
00:01:30.932 --> 00:01:31.892
"Why did you do that?"

21
00:01:32.232 --> 00:01:33.173
cried the Tang Monk.

22
00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:36.354
"You're a human, Master," said Wukong.

23
00:01:37.314 --> 00:01:40.815
"You couldn't see that the woman was really a spirit who wanted to harm you.

24
00:01:42.015 --> 00:01:43.716
Unfortunately she got away."

25
00:01:45.436 --> 00:01:46.476
are you so cruel?"

26
00:01:46.817 --> 00:01:47.477
asked the monk.

27
00:01:48.217 --> 00:01:49.517
"She was giving us food."

28
00:01:49.617 --> 00:01:52.638
"It's not food," said the monkey.

29
00:01:57.400 --> 00:02:01.057
He held up the bowl, which was filled with worms.

30
00:02:01.077 --> 00:02:05.300
"Don't believe Wukong," said Bajie.

31
00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:08.882
"He used magic to turn the food into worms."

32
00:02:09.942 --> 00:02:13.484
The pig looked at the ground where the woman had been and shook his head.

33
00:02:13.504 --> 00:02:17.987
"Wukong hit her so hard, there isn't anything left of her."

34
00:02:19.488 --> 00:02:21.769
"That's ridiculous," said Wukong.

35
00:02:27.436 --> 00:02:32.599
"I—ahh!" The monkey rolled on the ground as the Tang Monk recited the Tight Headband spell.

36
00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:35.300
Bajie laughed.

37
00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:38.402
"I didn't know you could do that, Master."

38
00:02:39.542 --> 00:02:42.384
Just then an old woman came down the road.

39
00:02:43.525 --> 00:02:46.966
The monk stopped reciting the spell, and Wukong stood up.

40
00:02:50.888 --> 00:02:53.610
looking for my daughter," said the woman.

41
00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:57.352
"She was bringing food to the Tang Monk."

42
00:02:58.612 --> 00:03:00.573
"Oh no," said the Tang Monk.

43
00:03:01.654 --> 00:03:03.114
Bajie stepped forward.

44
00:03:04.215 --> 00:03:06.676
"You should ask this monkey what happened to your daughter."

45
00:03:08.117 --> 00:03:10.918
Wukong looked at the old woman closely for a moment.

46
00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:17.421
he took out his iron bar and swung.

47
00:03:18.721 --> 00:03:19.842
But again he missed.

48
00:03:20.122 --> 00:03:22.743
"She got away again!"

49
00:03:23.103 --> 00:03:23.904
cried Wukong.

50
00:03:25.768 --> 00:03:27.870
"He killed another innocent person!"

51
00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:28.871
cried the pig.

52
00:03:28.891 --> 00:03:31.652
"Master, recite the spell!"

53
00:03:33.554 --> 00:03:35.615
Tang Monk recited the spell again.

54
00:03:35.635 --> 00:03:39.018
Wukong fell to the ground in pain.

55
00:03:39.078 --> 00:03:42.620
"Please stop!"

56
00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:43.781
cried the monkey.

57
00:03:45.422 --> 00:03:46.563
Tang Monk stopped.

58
00:03:46.583 --> 00:03:49.745
"Don't hurt any more people," he said.

59
00:03:49.805 --> 00:03:53.728
"If you do, I'll recite the spell until your head explodes."

60
00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:57.961
Just then an old man came down the road.

61
00:03:57.981 --> 00:04:02.563
"I'm looking for my wife and daughter," he said.

62
00:04:06.485 --> 00:04:09.146
the evil spirit woman again," thought Wukong.

63
00:04:09.166 --> 00:04:12.888
"If I don't destroy her, she'll harm the Tang Monk.

64
00:04:14.229 --> 00:04:17.850
But if I do hurt her, the monk will make my head explode."

65
00:04:20.151 --> 00:04:21.212
Wukong sighed.

66
00:04:22.316 --> 00:04:26.059
"I must protect the Tang Monk, no matter what," he thought.

67
00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:30.082
whipped out his iron bar and swung.

68
00:04:31.823 --> 00:04:34.245
There was a puff of smoke.

69
00:04:34.425 --> 00:04:37.727
When the smoke cleared, a skeleton lay on the ground.

70
00:04:39.128 --> 00:04:39.508
got her!"

71
00:04:39.789 --> 00:04:40.629
cried Wukong.

72
00:04:40.649 --> 00:04:43.591
"See? She was an evil skeleton spirit!"

73
00:04:45.132 --> 00:04:46.413
The Tang Monk frowned.

74
00:04:46.433 --> 00:04:50.076
"Recite the spell again," Bajie said to the monk.

75
00:04:52.276 --> 00:04:54.939
"I want you to leave, Wukong," said the Tang Monk.

76
00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:57.641
"Master," said the monkey.

77
00:04:57.661 --> 00:04:59.783
"I just saved your life."

78
00:04:59.803 --> 00:05:02.765
"I don't believe you," said the monk.

79
00:05:02.785 --> 00:05:05.848
"Now leave or I'll recite the spell again."

80
00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:08.550
became angry.

81
00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:11.913
"If you really want me to leave, I'll leave.

82
00:05:12.914 --> 00:05:15.236
But don't come looking for me when you need help!"

83
00:05:16.858 --> 00:05:19.160
He leaped into the air and vanished.
